WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:03.045
Good morning! Hello!

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.839
Nice scooter there, birthday boy!

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:09.593
A shirt that's funny
and also makes me feel bad.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.511
Love you, Dad.

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.348
Has that always been there?

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:18.060
That thing will tell you
your life's potential.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.104
-Where'd you get it?
-No idea.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.773
It just appeared…

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:23.982
like magic.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.570
You know what I got?

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.905
Superstar.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.156
Well, I got dancer.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.492
-Male model.
-Make it stop.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.493
What's going on?

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.120
Why is everybody trying
to change their lives overnight?

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:39.790
-We're getting a divorce.
-The Morpho inspired us.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.666
What was your card?

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:44.545
Healer.
A sign to engage in self-healing.

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:45.671
Or maybe it meant doctor,

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:48.382
as in the profession
that you do every day.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:52.135
You asked if I was happy.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.470
Are you happy?

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:54.805
I'm 40 years old.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:58.350
I have no discernable talent
apart from whistling.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:01.144
And I've only ever been
in one relationship.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.605
I don't know if I'm happy.

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:05.315
I've never had to think about it.

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:07.109
Which was nice, actually.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.654
It's not like I really believe
there's a magical machine

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.865
that can tell people
what they're capable of.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.285
But literally everyone is trying it.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:19.496
So they got together a week ago,
and now they're married.

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.539
That's fun.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:26.295
Maybe everything is not quite as it seems.

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:27.212
That is deep.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.298
I think I have everything I ever wanted.

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:31.300
Maybe you didn't want enough.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:32.759
This machine,

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.971
magic or not,
is reminding people…

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.766
our lives have more than
one possible path.

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:44.855
We have been asking
where the Morpho came from.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.356
What's inside it?

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:50.819
What we should be asking
is what's inside of us.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.909
You're going to decide
your own life potential.

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:04.583
What about you, Mr. Hubbard?

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.043
What are you gonna be?

